00:00:26.346 --> 00:00:28.430
- It's surreal to be given
the opportunity to do it again

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.560
after such a long period of time.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.147
The minute I got my hair cut into

00:00:32.147 --> 00:00:35.240
the shade and trim, I was good to go.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.220
You can look at culture
in the UK right now,

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:40.679
you look at music and
we're exploring a lot.

00:00:40.679 --> 00:00:43.610
We're giving a lot of our
product to the rest of the world.

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:47.020
So I just felt like it was
perfect timing actually

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.682
the six year gap that came by accident,

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.400
actually made it perfect.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.201
I think the world right
now is ready for the show.

00:00:55.201 --> 00:00:58.118
(heavy bass music)

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:02.060
(laughter)

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.810
- I became attached to the
characters and I brought it up

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:10.217
to my manager, my partner in crime, I said

00:01:10.217 --> 00:01:13.390
"Yo, we should try and bring this back."

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:15.043
- He always says to me when I talk to him

00:01:15.043 --> 00:01:17.670
that he's a fan of show
first and foremost,

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:19.987
he's passionate about the
show because he likes it

00:01:19.987 --> 00:01:22.037
and you couldn't get a better ambassador.

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:26.848
- Who's this, Michael Ward?

00:01:26.848 --> 00:01:27.931
Michael ward?

00:01:33.483 --> 00:01:35.750
- It's actually happening
man, I can't believe it.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:38.260
It still doesn't feel real to me.

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:40.460
I obviously started as
a fan so I just want

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:43.310
everyone to see what I've seen
because what I've watched,

00:01:44.279 --> 00:01:45.112
I've obviously watched it as a fan

00:01:45.112 --> 00:01:46.960
and then I know we've
created something special

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.930
and I can't wait for everyone to see it.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:53.390
I met Ashley back in '14,'15 begging him

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:56.200
for a role in Top Boy.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.070
- You need to read it aloud.

00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:00.770
- Wow the man's just taking
it in, but please read it.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:05.710
- Hello Ashley just thought
it was worth a try to DM you

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:07.830
to see if you have any productions, please

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:11.606
could you get me a role, I
wanna be as big as you one day.

00:02:11.606 --> 00:02:13.120
(applause)

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:15.773
- Hold on there's more,
there's more, there's more.

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:19.300
- How do I go about getting
a casting for Top Boy?

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:20.440
Please reply.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:24.163
- Crying emoji, Crying emoji.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.053
- It's mad.

00:02:34.596 --> 00:02:37.179
(upbeat music)

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:57.420
- To think this was like
all in the works a year ago

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:00.950
and now we're on a premier,
at the premier it's crazy.

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:04.080
We've come to Netflix now
we've still kept that rawness,

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:08.150
we've still kept that edge,
and that as well was so

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:09.840
beautiful on screen and so cinematic

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.840
and I think everyone's going to love it.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:14.710
I've been a fan of the show for so long

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.910
and to now know that I'm going
to be a part of the season

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.740
was crazy, I called my mom straight away

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:20.080
and was like, "guess what?"

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:22.670
- Twelve years ago, literally
around the corner from here,

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.840
I saw a kid on the street, dealing drugs

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.550
and that was the inspiration for Top Boy.

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:31.113
So to go from there to
here, has been a journey.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:45.537
- The top, its worth losing
your people, your family.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.190
- The slogan for this journey
that we're going on is

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:57.150
It's crowded at the top, to
be undisputed to where your

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:59.470
peers respect and fear
you at the same time

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.320
that to me is Top Boy.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.730
- Whatever mindset to get to the top

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:04.530
you have to fight for what you want.

